mtc-cnstr:NativeUnitEnum_GRAVITATIONALACCELERATION
    a owl:NamedIndividual, mtc-cnstr:NativeUnitEnum ;
    rdfs:label """GRAVITATIONAL_ACCELERATION""" ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """acceleration relative to earth's gravity given in meter per second squared.\n\n> Note 1 to entry: At different points on Earth's surface, the free-fall acceleration ranges from 9.764 to 9.834 m/s2 (Wikipedia: Gravitational Acceleration). The constant can be customized depending on the location in the universe.\n\n> Note 2 to entry: In the standard, it is assumed that Earth's average value of gravitational acceleration is 9.90665 m/s2.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

