    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """controller is configured to automatically execute a program.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum_MANUAL
    a owl:NamedIndividual, mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum ;
    rdfs:label """MANUAL""" ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """controller is not executing an active program. \n\nIt is capable of receiving instructions from an external source – typically an operator. The controller executes operations based on the instructions received from the external source.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum_MANUALDATAINPUT
    a owl:NamedIndividual, mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum ;
    rdfs:label """MANUAL_DATA_INPUT""" ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """operator can enter a series of operations for the controller to perform.\n\nThe controller will execute this specific series of operations and then stop.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum_SEMIAUTOMATIC
    a owl:NamedIndividual, mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum ;
    rdfs:label """SEMI_AUTOMATIC""" ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """controller is operating in a mode that restricts the active program from processing its next process step without operator intervention.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum_EDIT
    a owl:NamedIndividual, mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum ;
    rdfs:label """EDIT""" ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition """controller is currently functioning as a programming device and is not capable of executing an active program.""" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://model.mtconnect.org/ontology/machinetool/DataTypes/> .

mtc-cnstr:ControllerModeEnum_FEEDHOLD
